<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A5.F13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 13</span>: </span><span id="A5.F13.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison with production harnesses on WorkBuddy-Bench.<span id="A5.F13.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
